    "perspective": "top-down, straight from above, no tilt, no isometric view",
    "light": "soft light from the upper left (north-west); shadows fall to the lower right",
    "readability": "every square stays readable: high contrast between floor and obstacles, figures always on top, no clutter on walkable squares",
